00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:08.120 align:start position:0%
I wore this soccer suit during the  launch of my Principia mission in  December 2015 and again during my return  to Earth in June 2016 your soccer suit  is connected to the spacecraft's  life-support systems and provides  approximately two hours of oxygen and  carbon dioxide removal in the event of a  cabin depressurization and the suit is  tailored to fit individual cosmonauts we  first wear after soccer spacesuit at the  zvezda factory and this is probably  about a year prior to launch we have to  wear it for about an hour and in during  that time the suit is fully pressurized  so that we can evaluate how well the  suit fits us so it's really important  for the suit engineers to be able to get  the size right so that when you're  pressurized it doesn't cause you any  pain  the soccer shape is contoured for  sitting in the Soyuz couch in a fetal  sitting position and this shaping of the  suit makes it impossible to stand  upright that causes the cosmonauts stoop  as we walk out to the rocket it takes  about ten minutes to get the spacesuit  put on when you're doing this prior to  launch but if you really needed to get  into the Safin suit in an emergency you  could probably get it sealed up in about  two minutes  the gloves are detachable using bayonet  fixings and we wear boots over the feet  only for the walk to the launch the  rigid coat provides protection from  mechanical and thermal impact electrical  and air supply lines and hoses are  connected on the lower abdomen of the  suit and a large blue pressure regulator  is located centrally on the upper chest  with an associated press a gauge on the  right wrist of the suit the spacesuit is  not comfortable to stand up in but it's  actually very comfortable once you're  sat in the Soyuz seat but generally  speaking we wear the spacesuit for the  whole six hours between entry into orbit  and rendezvous with the space station  but I didn't have any problems with  during that time  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]
 

